# 1. Install Qt5 (one-time)
brew install qt@5

# 2. Initialize submodules (one-time)
cd ~/repos/writing-env/cool-retro-term
git submodule update --init --recursive

# 3. Generate Makefiles with qmake
/opt/homebrew/opt/qt@5/bin/qmake

# 4. Build
make -j$(sysctl -n hw.ncpu)

# 5. Copy to Applications (as test app)
cp -R cool-retro-term.app "/Applications/Retro Terminal TEST.app"
Steps 3-5 are what you repeat after making changes. The built app is at cool-retro-term/cool-retro-term.app.